@InternLink.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5275
@apiAddress = http://localhost:7109
@superAdminToken = replace-with-super-admin-jwt
@backupFile = InternLink_20261003_120000_000Z.bak

GET {{InternLink.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### List database backups (Super Admin)
GET {{apiAddress}}/api/SuperAdmin/backups
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a database backup (Super Admin)
POST {{apiAddress}}/api/SuperAdmin/backups
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Download one backup
GET {{apiAddress}}/api/SuperAdmin/backups/{{backupFile}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Delete one backup
DELETE {{apiAddress}}/api/SuperAdmin/backups/{{backupFile}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Restore rejects a request without the exact confirmation word
POST {{apiAddress}}/api/SuperAdmin/backups/{{backupFile}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirmation": "CONFIRM"
}

### DESTRUCTIVE: successful restore replaces the current database.
### Only send this request after selecting a backup and intentionally replacing current data.
# POST {{apiAddress}}/api/SuperAdmin/backups/{{backupFile}}/restore
# Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "confirmation": "RESTORE"
# }
